    <description>This package is deprecated as of Studio 23.10. 
Integration Service Connectors can now be used directly from the Project's Activities panel or Package Manager under All Connectors.

THIS VERSION REQUIRES THE PREVIEW CLOUD INTEGRATION SERVICE. UiPath Integration Service based automation activities for Oracle Eloqua. These activities allow you to execute create, retrieve, update, delete and File upload operations on Oracle Eloqua objects.</description>
    <copyright>© UiPath</copyright>
